The behaviour this package implements follows the shared logging
specification published with ServerLog (https://github.com/LeoHeco/ServerLog),
which is distributed under the MIT licence.

The case files of that specification are copied verbatim into
scripts/serlog-cases/, and its published configuration examples into
scripts/serlog-examples/; scripts/gen_cases.py and scripts/gen_examples.py turn
them into the MoonBit tests under src/. The code here is an independent
implementation of the model those files describe.
